## 📂 Problem Statements & Solutions

### 🔹 Challenge 1: Student Name Formatting

Convert all names into proper case.

```python
students = ("sunitha", "RAVI", "aNu")
formatted = tuple(name.capitalize() for name in students)
print(formatted)
```

✅ Output:
('Sunitha', 'Ravi', 'Anu')

---

### 🔹 Challenge 2: Count Total & Unique Subjects

```python
subjects = ("Math", "Science", "English", "Math", "Science")

total = len(subjects)
unique = len(set(subjects))

print("Total:", total)
print("Unique:", unique)
```

---

### 🔹 Challenge 3: Remove Extra Spaces

```python
feedback = (" good course ", " excellent ", "average ")
cleaned = tuple(f.strip() for f in feedback)
print(cleaned)
```

---

### 🔹 Challenge 4: Combine Name & Course

```python
names = ("Anu", "Ravi", "John")
courses = ("Python", "SQL", "Power BI")

combined = tuple(n + "-" + c for n, c in zip(names, courses))
print(combined)
```

---

### 🔹 Challenge 5: Extract Email Domains

```python
emails = ("anu@gmail.com", "ravi@yahoo.com", "john@edu.com")
domains = tuple(email.split("@")[1] for email in emails)
print(domains)
```

